OL,3,GNEWSAMore incentives needed to employ
OL,4,ANeets, says boss
OL,5,
OL,6,FA business chief in Worcester has
OL,7,Fbacked Alan Milburn's report on young
OL,8,Fpeople not in education, employment or
OL,9,Ftraining (Neets) and said employers
OL,10,Fneeded greater incentives to take them
OL,11,Fon.
OL,13,FSimon Lancaster, the founder of SJL
OL,14,FInsurance Services, told the BBC the
OL,15,Fgovernment should focus on creating
OL,16,F"favourable conditions" so businesses
OL,17,Fcould hire more under-25s.
OL,19,FIt comes after Milburn recommended a
OL,20,Fshake-up of the benefits system, early
OL,21,Fintervention in schools and tax cuts
OL,22,Ffor hiring companies.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
