OL,3,GNEWSAMore incentives needed to employ
OL,4,ANeets, says boss
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think young people do make great
OL,7,Femployees - we've just got to make it
OL,8,Feasier for businesses to hire them,"
OL,9,Fsaid Lancaster.
